t;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This screening session features 11 films.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;FILM SCHEDULE&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you for your souvenir, UK! (United Kingdom) by Oushi Lin&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Limina (United Kingdom) by Jared Watmuff&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Mãe (United Kingdom) by Alfred Addis&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The End of the World (United Kingdom) by Ali Aschman&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The Dream Machine (France) by Michael William West&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Flock 众 (United Kingdom) by Fiona Jingxin Chen&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Bona Vacantia (United Kingdom) by Shezah Salam&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Dog’s Leg (United Kingdom) by Joe Dodd&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The Whole World Blind (or: The Ballad of The Cuck and The Eunuch) (United Kingdom) by Finbar Somers, Seán Mackey&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Immaculate Deception (United Kingdom) by Emily Lucienne&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Our Males and Females (Jordan) by Ahmad Alyaseer&lt;/p&gt;\"/>\n  <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.supershorts.org/events/super-shorts-london-session-3-6\"/>\n  <meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index\"/>\n  <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Super Shorts London - Session 3 | Super Shorts\"/>\n  <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WARNING!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;To validate this ticket, please arrive at the cinema between 30 and 10 minutes before the screening starts to claim your seat. After this, non-claimed seats will be freed up to people who did not reserve a ticket.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If you need to cancel, please let us know by email: info&amp;#64;supershorts.org&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This screening session features 11 films.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;FILM SCHEDULE&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you for your souvenir, UK! (United Kingdom) by Oushi Lin&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Limina (United Kingdom) by Jared Watmuff&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Mãe (Uni